[size=4]Mantella Living World - Arousal[/size]

Tells Mantella how aroused NPCs are, so they act on it in their own way.

[size=3]Temperament[/size]
[table]
[tr][th]Temperament[/th][th]Aroused[/th][th]At her peak[/th][/tr]
[tr][td]Reserved[/td][td]Keeps it to herself[/td][td]Hints at most[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Bold[/td][td]Lets it show, drops hints[/td][td]Asks you directly, accepts no[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Forward[/td][td]Says it openly[/td][td]Begs (never starts a scene without you)[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[size=3]Appetite[/size]
[table]
[tr][th]State[/th][th]What happens[/th][/tr]
[tr][td]Rated[/td][td]Mantella rates her appetite once, from her bio[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Counting[/td][td]Climaxes this session are counted against it[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Satisfied[/td][td]Arousal drops; she is content[/td][/tr]
[tr][td]Overwhelmed[/td][td]Far past it; she asks to rest[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[size=3]Requirements[/size]
[table]
[tr][th]Mod[/th][th]Needed[/th][/tr]
[tr][td][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/196849]Mantella Living World - Integration Hub[/url][/td][td]Yes[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/98631]Mantella[/url][/td][td]Yes[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/65454]OSL Aroused[/url][/td][td]Yes[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[size=3]Notes[/size]
[list]
[*]Climaxes are counted from OStim scenes and from what NPCs report in conversation.
[*]Temperament is set per NPC in the hub (hotkey) or left on Auto.
[/list]
